# Evals

Scenarios that check the skill does what `SKILL.md` says. Each scenario is one Markdown file
with three sections: the prompt a person would give, the behavior expected, and the criteria a
reviewer uses to say pass or fail. Add a scenario for every rule in `SKILL.md` that matters.

Start with `001-triggers-on-the-right-request.md`. Run the set before each release and record
the result in `governance/decisions.yaml` or the changelog.
